  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Bipin Kumar Sahu vs State Of Odisha .... Opposite Party on 26 September, 2025 Author: V. Narasingh Bench: V. Narasingh In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Ablapl No. 11210 of 2025 Bipin Kumar Sahu .... Petitioner Mr. S.K. Pattnaik, Advocate -versus- State of Odisha .... Opposite Party Mr. C.R. Swain, Aga Coram: Justice V. Narasingh Order Order No. 26.09.2025 01. 1.",
    "facts": "2. The Petitioner is seeking pre-arrest bail in connection with G.R. Case No. 2723 of 2022 pending in the Court of the learned S.D.J.M., Berhampur arising out of Gopalpur P.S. Case No. 230 of 2022 for commission of offences punishable under Section 420/272/273/34 of IPC read with Section 20/24 of Cigarettes & Other Tobacco Products Act and Section 51 / 52 / 53 / 56 / 57 / 59 / 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. Admittedly the Petitioner was before this Court in ABLAPL No.14636 of 2022 as Petitioner No.2 and by order dated 19.12.2022 this Court granted liberty to the Petitioner to surrender and seek for bail. 4.",
    "arguments": "It is submitted by the learned counsel for the Petitioner that since in the meanwhile charge sheet has been filed, the Petitioner may be protected by pre-arrest bail.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "It is submitted by the learned counsel for the Petitioner that since in the meanwhile charge sheet has been filed, the Petitioner may be protected by pre-arrest bail.",
